~ start
#bg=milky_meadow
#sfx=open

Narrator: Welcome to Milka VN! 🥛
Narrator: A gentle breeze sweeps across the creamy meadow, carrying the sweet scent of fresh milk. #sfx=confirm

#sprite=milka_chan_smile:center
#anim=bounce
Milka: "Nya~ Welcome traveler! I'm Milka-chan, your milky guide!" #sfx=click
Milka: "I'm so excited to meet you today!"

#sprite=milka_chan:center
Milka: "This is just the beginning. You can write your own story now."
Milka: "Replace my placeholder art with your own character sprites in 'assets/characters/'."

- "Tell me about the backgrounds!"
    #bg=cafe_parlor
    #sprite=milka_chan_smile:center
    Milka: "Look! This is the cozy café parlor background!" #sfx=open
    Milka: "Replace these SVG placeholders with your own beautiful WebP backgrounds." #sfx=confirm
    -> branch_continue

- "What about animations?"
    #sprite=milka_chan_surprised:center
    #anim=shake
    Milka: "Oh! Watch me shake with excitement!" #sfx=error
    #sprite=milka_chan_smile:center
    #anim=bounce
    Milka: "And here's a cheerful bounce!" #sfx=click
    #anim=nod
    Milka: "I can also nod thoughtfully~" #sfx=confirm
    -> branch_continue

- "Show me all the sound effects!"
    #sprite=milka_chan_smile:center
    Milka: "Let me play through all the preserved SFX!" #sfx=click
    #sfx=save
    Milka: "That's the save sound!"
    #sfx=open
    Milka: "Menu open sound!"
    #sfx=close
    Milka: "And close!"
    #sfx=confirm
    Milka: "Finally, the confirmation chime!" #sfx=confirm
    -> branch_continue

~ branch_continue
#bg=starry_night
#sprite=milka_chan_smile:center
Milka: "Look, the starry night has arrived!" #sfx=open

#sprite=milka_chan:center
Milka: "Now the stage is all yours."
Milka: "Edit 'dialogue/milka.dialogue' to write your own story."
Milka: "Add your characters to 'assets/characters/' and backgrounds to 'assets/backgrounds/'."

#sprite=milka_chan_smile:center
#anim=bounce
Milka: "Thank you for choosing Milka VN! May your stories be as sweet as chocolate milk! ✨🥛" #sfx=confirm

Narrator: [End of prologue — the stage is yours!]
=> END
